      "summary": "A dispatched call that raised a TypeError before running (state_persistence not_attempted, no ACK) leaves record_writes (ack_inventory_mismatch) and slack.messages inventories incomplete (Luna hr.job_posting_distribution, google_sheets_create_spreadsheet without title); all guards abstain.",
